{"id":"n40395-4-7","stage":3,"title":"느끼하다 · 肉麻","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40395-4-7-1","ko":"너의 까만 눈동자는 저 하늘의 달과 별보다도 아름답게 빛나는구나.","zh":"你的黑色眼眸，比天上的月亮和星星还要美丽动人呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너의","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너의","audio":"/audio/7256bdfdfb5852c2a596.mp3"}},{"text":"까만","meaning":"乌黑，漆黑","explanation":"까맣다：乌黑，漆黑；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"까맣다","audio":"/audio/bc133da98e99a2281b43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64358","senseId":"1","lemma":"까맣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"까만","audio":"/audio/176db3af52f8b2dd4377.mp3"}},{"text":"눈동자는","meaning":"眼珠，瞳孔，眸子","explanation":"눈동자：眼珠，瞳孔，眸子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"눈동자","audio":"/audio/c18423b154a0917cea68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23410","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈동자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈동자는","audio":"/audio/078e93f8be6bb90f2e4c.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"하늘의","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘의","audio":"/audio/fbdf3fb3435bdd836018.mp3"}},{"text":"달과","meaning":"月，月亮，月球","explanation":"달：月，月亮，月球；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"1","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달과","audio":"/audio/950c1a8ffe6a8576afac.mp3"}},{"text":"별보다도","meaning":"星星","explanation":"별：星星；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58366","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별보다도","audio":"/audio/83da9aef1a8128561967.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답게","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답게","audio":"/audio/be0da9573a37d20dd913.mp3"}},{"text":"빛나는구나.","meaning":"闪光，闪烁，发光","explanation":"빛나다：闪光，闪烁，发光；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"빛나다","audio":"/audio/a7936a104a33327719b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15642","senseId":"2","lemma":"빛나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빛나는구나","audio":"/audio/6e0647c1118330050150.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc133da98e99a228","term":"까맣다","zh":"乌黑，漆黑","audio":"/audio/bc133da98e99a2281b43.mp3","entryId":"64358","definition":"颜色像没有一丝光亮的夜空一样黑。","pronunciation":["까ː마타"]},{"id":"c18423b154a0917c","term":"눈동자","zh":"眼珠，瞳孔，眸子","audio":"/audio/c18423b154a0917cea68.mp3","entryId":"23410","definition":"眼球中间的黑色部分。","pronunciation":["눈똥자"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月，月亮，月球","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"晚上天空中出现的圆形明亮的发光天体。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"星星","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"58366","definition":"夜空中闪闪发光的、除了月亮以外的天体。","pronunciation":["별ː"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"a7936a104a333277","term":"빛나다","zh":"闪光，闪烁，发光","audio":"/audio/a7936a104a33327719b2.mp3","entryId":"15642","definition":"光被反射而一闪一闪或发亮。","pronunciation":["빈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/87d7ba9d6550d6702f85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40395-4-7-2","ko":"느끼하게 왜 이래?","zh":"怎么这么肉麻啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"느끼하게","meaning":"肉麻，腻人","explanation":"느끼하다：肉麻，腻人；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"느끼하다","audio":"/audio/e1d77341c32cacddffff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40395","senseId":"4","lemma":"느끼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느끼하게","audio":"/audio/8710726e80cae090d3cc.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이래?","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이래","audio":"/audio/3a39ae7086b354ae31c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e1d77341c32cacdd","term":"느끼하다","zh":"肉麻，腻人","audio":"/audio/e1d77341c32cacddffff.mp3","entryId":"40395","definition":"某人的行为或口气等油滑且令人反感。","pronunciation":["느끼하다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","